      "source": "https://main.sbcounty.gov/2025/03/27/san-bernardino-county-history-trona/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every October, the Searles Lake Gem and Mineral Society hosts Gem‑O‑Rama in Trona to teach kids about the unique minerals found in the lakebed.",
